+        channel — most sightings happen on a single snorkel or dive.
+      </p>
+      <div class="agatti-card-grid">
+        <div class="agatti-card"><span class="icon">🐢</span><h4>Sea turtles</h4><p>Regularly seen grazing on seagrass beds in the shallower parts of the lagoon.</p></div>
+        <div class="agatti-card"><span class="icon">🐟</span><h4>Reef fish</h4><p>Triggerfish, snappers, sweetlips, and butterflyfish crowd the coral heads in dense, colourful schools.</p></div>
