+        <div class="agatti-card"><span class="icon">🐠</span><h4>Rays</h4><p>Rays are a common sighting gliding over the sandy patches between coral formations.</p></div>
+        <div class="agatti-card"><span class="icon">🐡</span><h4>Barracuda &amp; jackfish</h4><p>Larger open-water fish often seen cruising in loose schools near the channel and reef edge.</p></div>
